**Drueidian** (/' *druɪdiən* /, <a href="drueidian">Drueidian</a>: *ⴷⵔⵓⵉⴷⵉⴻⵏ*) is the <a href="history-and-overview-of-the-languages-of-iagoband">language</a> which developed separately within the <a href="ootl">Otlan</a> religion. Most native Drueidian speakers also fluently speak another language. Its language shares no similarities or lineages with any languages, suggesting it was created at some point in history. Yet this vital piece of information is unknown.

